==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns.
*2 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*8 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[CTO Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The high magnification of the Shy Boys may look intimidating, but a few meatshields should do the trick. Be sure to bring your best [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Red]]/[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] nukers here. Nearly any Uber that outranges the CTO Seals and The Face will do well.

